# Geometric rug (issue 166): mustard and brick, a row of brick diamonds with cream centres on a mustard field, a brick border with a thin walnut inner line, cream fringe at the short ends. Seen from above (flat, like a floor), ink outline, no print. 4x2 tiles. Lies on the floor under the player.
size: 64x32
